## Dependencies

This workflow runs basic-memory as its external MCP server. Agents on Claude Code, Codex CLI, Gemini CLI, Kimi CLI, and OpenCode connect to that server for shared memory. backlog.md stays a CLI.

| Dependency | License | Scope | Note |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `basic-memory` | AGPL-3.0 | MCP subprocess (`uvx basic-memory mcp`) | Runs as a separate process; does not affect this project's license. Vault: `Docbase/memory/` |
| `backlog.md` | MIT | CLI | Task lifecycle |

### Vault Privacy (opt-in)

`Docbase/memory/` vault is included in git → all worktrees share the same knowledge base, audit-friendly in PRs. To exclude sensitive content from git, add the Docbase path to Codebase's `.gitignore` (git runs on the Codebase side). If Codebase and Docbase are not in the same git tree, the vault is already outside git.

```
# Codebase/.gitignore (vault under Docbase/, relative to Codebase)
../Docbase/memory/
```

> If you exclude the vault from git, cloud sync (basic-memory cloud option) or manual sync is required for the same memory access across machines.

